				},
				"description": "API - Update Investment_Status_c__c on Account\n\n**Test ID:** SF-484-API-003\n**Priority:** p1\n**Tags:** @api-update\n\n**Prerequisite:** Requires an existing Account record (set account_id variable)"
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
			"name": "SF-484-API-004 - Query Account by Investment_Status_c",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
